# Release credentials for `scripts/distribute.sh`. Copy to `.env` (gitignored)
# and fill in. Nothing here is needed to develop: `vp dev` and `cargo build`
# run without this file, with telemetry compiled out.
#
# The website build reads INKRA_POSTHOG_KEY and INKRA_POSTHOG_HOST from this
# same file, but does not load it on its own — see docs/website-deploy.md.

# --- Apple codesigning and notarization ---------------------------------
# The identity must be a *Developer ID Application* certificate, issued only
# under a paid Apple Developer Program membership. An Apple Development
# certificate looks similar and will not notarize. Check what you have with:
#   security find-identity -v -p codesigning
APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY="Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)"

# Apple ID used to submit to notarization, and an app-specific password for it
# generated at https://appleid.apple.com — not the account password.
APPLE_ID="you@example.com"
APPLE_PASSWORD="xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx"
APPLE_TEAM_ID="XXXXXXXXXX"

# --- Tauri updater signing ----------------------------------------------
# Not set here. The key and its passphrase live in the macOS keychain, under
# the services `inkra-updater-key` and `inkra-updater-key-password` with the
# account `inkra`, and distribute.sh reads them from there. Set these two only
# to override the keychain — an explicit value wins.
#
# The key's public half is pinned in tauri.conf.json under
# plugins.updater.pubkey. Losing the key means published installs can no longer
# verify any future update, and there is no recovery path.
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=""
# TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY_PASSWORD=""

# --- Telemetry ----------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled in at build time. Without it the release works normally and simply
# never reports anything, so distribute.sh refuses to build unless the
# omission is explicit. See docs/telemetry.md.
INKRA_POSTHOG_KEY="phc_..."
# INKRA_RELEASE_WITHOUT_TELEMETRY=1

# Overrides the ingestion host for both the app and the website. Defaults to
# https://us.i.posthog.com.
# INKRA_POSTHOG_HOST="https://eu.i.posthog.com"
